---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const install = 'curl -fsSL https://docs.inseam.io/install.sh | sh';
---

<Layout
	title="inseam — all your context, accessible anywhere"
	description="inseam indexes your data where it sits and gives agents, apps, and people one way to find and fetch all of it. content never moves. addresses do."
>
	<header class="nav">
		<a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="inseam home">
			<span>inseam</span>
			<svg viewBox="0 0 394 50" width="64" height="8" aria-hidden="true">
				<circle cx="25" cy="25" r="25" fill="var(--ink)"></circle>
				<rect x="58" y="7.5" width="49" height="35" fill="var(--thread)"></rect>
				<rect x="115" y="7.5" width="49" height="35" fill="var(--thread)"></rect>
				<circle cx="197" cy="25" r="25" fill="var(--ink)"></circle>
				<rect x="230" y="7.5" width="49" height="35" fill="var(--thread)"></rect>
				<rect x="287" y="7.5" width="49" height="35" fill="var(--thread)"></rect>
				<circle cx="369" cy="25" r="25" fill="var(--ink)"></circle>
			</svg>
		</a>
		<nav aria-label="primary">
			<a href="https://docs.inseam.io">docs</a>
			<a href="https://docs.inseam.io/plugins/">plugins</a>
			<a href="https://github.com/aiuitech/inseam">github</a>
			<a class="cta" href="https://docs.inseam.io/get-started">get started</a>
		</nav>
	</header>

	<main>
		<section class="hero">
			<h1>all your context,<br />accessible anywhere.</h1>
			<p class="sub">content never moves. addresses do.</p>
			<button class="install" type="button" data-command={install} aria-label="copy install command">
				<span class="prompt" aria-hidden="true">$</span>
				<code>{install}</code>
				<svg class="copy-glyph" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">
					<rect x="5.5" y="5.5" width="9" height="9" rx="1.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"></rect>
					<path d="M10.5 3.5v-1a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-7a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v7a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"></path>
				</svg>
				<span class="copied" role="status">copied</span>
			</button>
		</section>

		<section class="diagram" aria-label="how the network fits together">
			<svg viewBox="0 0 960 470" role="img" aria-labelledby="diagram-title">
				<title id="diagram-title"
					>three nodes — a laptop, a phone, a cloud node — joined by stitch lines. envelopes travel between
					them while content dots stay fixed inside each node.</title
				>

				<g class="threads">
					<path id="thread-a" d="M 258 190 C 330 128, 400 128, 450 178" />
					<path id="thread-b" d="M 520 262 C 582 322, 640 322, 698 264" />
					<path id="thread-c" d="M 232 272 C 400 368, 610 366, 726 288" />
				</g>

				<g class="nodes">
					<g class="device">
						<rect x="120" y="158" width="132" height="86" rx="6"></rect>
						<path d="M 104 258 h 164 l -14 -14 h -136 z"></path>
						<circle class="dot" cx="156" cy="188" r="4.5"></circle>
						<circle class="dot" cx="188" cy="214" r="4.5"></circle>
						<circle class="dot" cx="219" cy="184" r="4.5"></circle>
						<circle class="dot" cx="167" cy="224" r="4.5"></circle>
					</g>
					<g class="device">
						<rect x="452" y="152" width="66" height="128" rx="10"></rect>
						<line x1="472" y1="164" x2="498" y2="164"></line>
						<circle class="dot" cx="477" cy="200" r="4.5"></circle>
						<circle class="dot" cx="495" cy="234" r="4.5"></circle>
						<circle class="dot" cx="480" cy="258" r="4.5"></circle>
					</g>
					<g class="device">
						<path
							d="M 730 262 a 34 34 0 0 1 6 -67 a 44 44 0 0 1 84 -8 a 30 30 0 0 1 22 52 a 26 26 0 0 1 -24 23 z"
						></path>
						<circle class="dot" cx="768" cy="222" r="4.5"></circle>
						<circle class="dot" cx="800" cy="240" r="4.5"></circle>
						<circle class="dot" cx="826" cy="216" r="4.5"></circle>
					</g>
				</g>

				<g class="envelopes">
					<g class="env env-a">
						<rect x="-12" y="-8" width="24" height="16" rx="2.5"></rect>
						<path d="M -10 -5 L 0 3 L 10 -5"></path>
					</g>
					<g class="env env-b">
						<rect x="-12" y="-8" width="24" height="16" rx="2.5"></rect>
						<path d="M -10 -5 L 0 3 L 10 -5"></path>
					</g>
					<g class="env env-c">
						<rect x="-12" y="-8" width="24" height="16" rx="2.5"></rect>
						<path d="M -10 -5 L 0 3 L 10 -5"></path>
					</g>
				</g>

				<g class="labels">
					<g>
						<path class="leader" d="M 160 232 C 140 300, 120 330, 108 352" />
						<text x="36" y="374">sources stay</text>
						<text x="36" y="392">on their hosts</text>
					</g>
					<g>
						<path class="leader" d="M 476 338 C 470 360, 466 378, 462 394" />
						<text x="400" y="416">only addresses sync</text>
					</g>
					<g>
						<path class="leader" d="M 806 176 C 818 148, 826 130, 832 114" />
						<text x="700" y="84">verified identity reads</text>
						<text x="700" y="102">exactly what it is granted</text>
					</g>
				</g>
			</svg>
			<ul class="diagram-key" aria-hidden="true">
				<li>sources stay on their hosts</li>
				<li>only addresses sync</li>
				<li>verified identity reads exactly what it is granted</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section class="concepts">
			<article>
				<h2>data does not move.</h2>
				<p>
					inseam indexes your email, files, chats, and records where they already live. the network syncs
					addresses and small envelopes — never content. there is no second silo to trust or pay for.
				</p>
				<p class="stage">shipping today.</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h2>access is first-class.</h2>
				<p>
					an outside requester proves a property — <span class="lit">email:you@example.com</span> — and can
					discover exactly the sources carrying it. no user database anywhere; relevance and permission are
					the same question.
				</p>
				<p class="stage">designed; the boundary is not built yet, and we say so.</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h2>plugins meant for ai to build.</h2>
				<p>
					everything the node does is a sandboxed plugin on a small typed seam. when a connector is missing,
					your own agent writes it and mounts it safely, minutes later — the first shipped plugin was written
					by an agent.
				</p>
				<p class="stage">shipping today.</p>
			</article>
		</section>

		<section class="ladder">
			<h2>discovery is a ladder, not a dump.</h2>
			<p class="ladder-intro">
				query returns ranked addresses. expand and scan pull fragments from promising ones. fetch retrieves a
				full source only when it earns it — an agent gets progressively closer instead of twenty chunks up
				front.
			</p>
			<pre
				class="session"><code><span class="line"><span class="prompt">$</span> inseam query "sync design decisions"</span>
<span class="line out">  1  inseam://fs/~/ws/inseam/design/sync.md      envelopes sync; content stays</span>
<span class="line out">  2  inseam://fs/~/ws/inseam/design/plugins.md   two tiers, one seam</span>
<span class="line out">  3  inseam://gmail/thread/18f2c40a1            re: node discovery ladder</span>
<span class="line"><span class="prompt">$</span> inseam expand 1</span>
<span class="line out">  … addresses and their envelopes sync to every node; content stays put …</span>
<span class="line"><span class="prompt">$</span> inseam fetch 1</span>
<span class="line out">  design/sync.md — fetched from its host<span class="caret" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></code></pre>
			<p class="stage">the shape of a real session; paths are illustrative.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="open">
			<h2>open source. extend it indefinitely.</h2>
			<p>
				the core is small and stays small: a kernel that runs plugins, and plugins for everything else. no
				company roadmap caps what it reaches — the community and your own agents write the long tail, and one
				conformance harness gates every install. the hosted node is an ordinary node with no special powers.
			</p>
			<button class="install" type="button" data-command={install} aria-label="copy install command">
				<span class="prompt" aria-hidden="true">$</span>
				<code>{install}</code>
				<svg class="copy-glyph" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">
					<rect x="5.5" y="5.5" width="9" height="9" rx="1.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"></rect>
					<path d="M10.5 3.5v-1a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-7a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v7a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"></path>
				</svg>
				<span class="copied" role="status">copied</span>
			</button>
			<p class="open-link"><a href="https://github.com/aiuitech/inseam">source on github</a></p>
		</section>
	</main>

	<footer>
		<svg viewBox="0 0 394 50" width="96" height="12" aria-hidden="true">
			<circle cx="25" cy="25" r="25" fill="var(--ink)"></circle>
			<rect x="58" y="7.5" width="49" height="35" fill="var(--thread)"></rect>
			<rect x="115" y="7.5" width="49" height="35" fill="var(--thread)"></rect>
			<circle cx="197" cy="25" r="25" fill="var(--ink)"></circle>
			<rect x="230" y="7.5" width="49" height="35" fill="var(--thread)"></rect>
			<rect x="287" y="7.5" width="49" height="35" fill="var(--thread)"></rect>
			<circle cx="369" cy="25" r="25" fill="var(--ink)"></circle>
		</svg>
		<p>inseam. early, and described as early.</p>
	</footer>
</Layout>

<script>
	for (const button of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.install')) {
		button.addEventListener('click', async () => {
			const command = button.dataset.command;
			if (!command) return;
			try {
				await navigator.clipboard.writeText(command);
				button.classList.add('is-copied');
				setTimeout(() => button.classList.remove('is-copied'), 1600);
			} catch {
				const range = document.createRange();
				const code = button.querySelector('code');
				if (code) {
					range.selectNodeContents(code);
					const selection = getSelection();
					selection?.removeAllRanges();
					selection?.addRange(range);
				}
			}
		});
	}
</script>

<style>
	.nav {
		position: sticky;
		top: 0;
		z-index: 10;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		max-width: 72rem;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 1.4rem clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline);
		background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ground) 92%, transparent);
		backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
	}

	.wordmark {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		gap: 0.7rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.wordmark:hover {
		color: var(--ink);
	}

	.nav nav {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.nav nav a {
		text-decoration: none;
		color: var(--ink-dim);
	}

	.nav nav a:hover {
		color: var(--thread);
	}

	.nav nav a.cta {
		color: var(--ground);
		background: var(--thread);
		padding: 0.45rem 0.95rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-weight: 700;
		transition: filter 120ms ease-out;
	}

	.nav nav a.cta:hover {
		color: var(--ground);
		filter: brightness(1.12);
	}

	main {
		max-width: 72rem;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
	}

	.hero {
		text-align: center;
		padding: clamp(3rem, 8vh, 5.5rem) 0 clamp(1rem, 3vh, 2rem);
	}

	.hero h1 {
		font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 6.2vw, 4.4rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.14;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.hero .sub {
		margin-top: 1.4rem;
		color: var(--ink-dim);
		font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);
	}

	.install {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.7rem;
		margin-top: 2.4rem;
		padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem;
		font: inherit;
		font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 2.4vw, 1rem);
		color: var(--thread);
		background: none;
		border: none;
		cursor: pointer;
		position: relative;
	}

	.install .prompt {
		color: var(--ink-faint);
	}

	.install code {
		font: inherit;
	}

	.install .copy-glyph {
		color: var(--ink-faint);
		transition: color 120ms ease-out;
		flex: none;
	}

	.install:hover .copy-glyph {
		color: var(--thread);
	}

	.install .copied {
		position: absolute;
		right: 0;
		top: calc(100% + 0.15rem);
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		color: var(--ink-dim);
		opacity: 0;
		transition: opacity 160ms ease-out;
	}

	.install.is-copied .copied {
		opacity: 1;
	}

	.diagram {
		padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vh, 3rem) 0 0;
	}

	.diagram svg {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
	}

	.threads path {
		fill: none;
		stroke: var(--thread);
		stroke-width: 2.5;
		stroke-linecap: round;
		stroke-dasharray: 16 11 16 11 0.01 11;
		filter: drop-shadow(0 0 9px rgba(216, 255, 28, 0.55));
	}

	.nodes .device rect,
	.nodes .device path,
	.nodes .device line {
		fill: none;
		stroke: var(--ink);
		stroke-width: 2;
		stroke-linejoin: round;
		stroke-linecap: round;
		opacity: 0.85;
	}

	.nodes .dot {
		fill: var(--ink);
		stroke: none;
		opacity: 1;
	}

	.envelopes .env rect {
		fill: var(--ground);
		stroke: var(--thread);
		stroke-width: 2;
	}

	.envelopes .env path {
		fill: none;
		stroke: var(--thread);
		stroke-width: 2;
		stroke-linejoin: round;
	}

	.env {
		offset-rotate: 0deg;
	}

	.env-a {
		offset-path: path('M 258 190 C 330 128, 400 128, 450 178');
		animation: travel 7s linear infinite;
	}

	.env-b {
		offset-path: path('M 520 262 C 582 322, 640 322, 698 264');
		animation: travel 7s linear infinite;
		animation-delay: -2.4s;
	}

	.env-c {
		offset-path: path('M 232 272 C 400 368, 610 366, 726 288');
		animation: travel 9.5s linear infinite;
		animation-delay: -5s;
	}

	@keyframes travel {
		from {
			offset-distance: 0%;
		}
		to {
			offset-distance: 100%;
		}
	}

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.env-a,
		.env-b,
		.env-c {
			animation: none;
			offset-distance: 45%;
		}
	}

	.labels .leader {
		fill: none;
		stroke: var(--ink);
		stroke-width: 1;
		opacity: 0.35;
	}

	.labels text {
		fill: var(--ink-dim);
		font-family: var(--mono);
		font-size: 15px;
	}

	.diagram-key {
		display: none;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.labels {
			display: none;
		}

		.diagram-key {
			display: grid;
			gap: 0.4rem;
			list-style: none;
			margin-top: 1.4rem;
			color: var(--ink-dim);
			font-size: 0.85rem;
		}

		.diagram-key li {
			display: flex;
			align-items: baseline;
			gap: 0.55rem;
		}

		.diagram-key li::before {
			content: '';
			flex: none;
			width: 7px;
			height: 7px;
			border-radius: 50%;
			background: var(--thread);
		}
	}

	.concepts {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
		padding: clamp(4rem, 10vh, 7rem) 0 0;
	}

	.concepts h2 {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
	}

	@media (min-width: 1150px) {
		.concepts h2 {
			white-space: nowrap;
		}
	}

	.concepts p {
		color: var(--ink-dim);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.concepts .lit {
		color: var(--thread);
	}

	.stage {
		margin-top: 0.9rem;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--ink-faint);
	}

	@media (max-width: 800px) {
		.concepts {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2.6rem;
		}
	}

	.ladder {
		padding: clamp(4.5rem, 11vh, 7.5rem) 0 0;
		max-width: 46rem;
	}

	.ladder h2,
	.open h2 {
		font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 1.9rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
		margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
	}

	.ladder-intro {
		color: var(--ink-dim);
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		max-width: 60ch;
	}

	.session {
		margin-top: 2.2rem;
		padding-left: 1.1rem;
		border-left: 1px solid var(--hairline);
		font-size: clamp(0.72rem, 1.8vw, 0.88rem);
		line-height: 1.75;
		overflow-x: auto;
	}

	.session .prompt {
		color: var(--thread);
	}

	.session .out {
		color: var(--ink-dim);
	}

	.caret {
		display: inline-block;
		width: 0.55em;
		height: 1em;
		vertical-align: text-bottom;
		margin-left: 0.2em;
		background: var(--thread);
		animation: blink 1.1s steps(2, jump-none) infinite;
	}

	@keyframes blink {
		to {
			opacity: 0;
		}
	}

	.ladder .stage {
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}

	.open {
		padding: clamp(4.5rem, 11vh, 7.5rem) 0 clamp(4rem, 9vh, 6rem);
		max-width: 46rem;
	}

	.open p {
		color: var(--ink-dim);
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		max-width: 62ch;
	}

	.open .install {
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	.open-link {
		margin-top: 1.6rem;
	}

	footer {
		max-width: 72rem;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2.2rem clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2.5rem) 2.8rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	footer p {
		color: var(--ink-faint);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.nav {
			gap: 0.75rem;
			padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
		}

		.wordmark svg {
			display: none;
		}

		.nav nav {
			font-size: 0.78rem;
			gap: 0.7rem;
		}

		.nav .cta {
			padding: 0.35rem 0.6rem;
			white-space: nowrap;
		}

		.install {
			max-width: 100%;
			flex-wrap: wrap;
			justify-content: flex-start;
			align-items: flex-start;
			text-align: left;
			font-size: 0.72rem;
		}

		.install code {
			white-space: normal;
			max-width: calc(100% - 3.2rem);
		}

		.install .copy-glyph {
			margin-top: 0.2rem;
		}

		footer {
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: flex-start;
			gap: 1rem;
		}
	}
</style>
